OL,3,GNEWSATeen who died in crash after
OL,4,Apolice pursuit named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy who died in a crash
OL,7,Ffollowing a police pursuit has been
OL,8,Fnamed.
OL,10,FOscar Hathway, from Knowle, south
OL,11,FBristol, was the passenger of a white
OL,12,FNissan Juke that was involved in a
OL,13,Fcrash with a black Audi S3 being driven
OL,14,Fby members of the public on the A37
OL,15,FWells Road just after 04:00 on Sunday,
OL,16,FAvon and Somerset Police said.
OL,18,FA 17-year-old boy who was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,20,Fdriving has been released on
OL,21,Fconditional bail.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
